  "changes": [
    "Reuse 4-8 Worker isolates per dispatch, CPU dependent; timed-out isolates retire without replacement.",
    "Prioritize critical gates and start each hook budget when execution begins; enforce a separate deadline within settings.json timeout.",
    "Return an explicit denial when a critical hook cannot complete; queue exhaustion is never timeout-as-pass.",
    "Isolate stdout/stderr/stdin/argv/exitCode/env, preserve legacy async and beforeExit output, cancel native timers including timers/promises before reuse.",
    "selectAnchor ignores untracked files while rejecting tracked unstaged/staged modifications."
  ],
